%% UX / server responsibilities are labelled. API keys are relative to /api. Policy and runtime evidence remain unapproved.
flowchart TD
    Unable["Generic unable-to-deliver state: no answer, no source reason; user may ask again"]
    Start["User submits POST /knowledge/questions using application session"]
    Read["1. Workspace checks session and current project/document scope; Knowledge retrieves permitted evidence"]
    Scope["Current-only by default; explicit labelled history; no Draft; operational facts from current observations"]
    Enough{"At least one requested component has supporting evidence?"}
    Insufficient["Insufficient evidence; no hints about hidden sources; capability-aware Create action"]
    Provider["2. Guarded current access + validity; persist run ID and exact evidence before provider-input handoff"]
    Generate["Wait outside guard; buffer whole answer; no browser token streaming"]
    Validate["Validate exact server citations and claim support; invented citation invalidates entire draft"]
    Delivery["3. Guarded recheck of entire evidence set including uncited context, session and validity"]
    Safe{"Claims, exact citations, full evidence access and validity all pass?"}
    Withhold["Withhold entire invalid/unsafe draft; generic answer_withheld; no content, citations or source reason"]
    Retry["Bounded new attempt with remaining permitted evidence; repeat all checks"]
    Answer["Persist minimum delivery evidence; guard through response handoff; render answered / partially_answered / conflict"]
    Click["User opens exact citation"]
    Citation["4. GET /knowledge/citations/{document_id}/{version_id}/{passage_id}; guarded current protected read"]
    Inspect["Exact excerpt and version; label Current / Superseded / Archived; no substitution"]
    Unavailable["200 unavailable: verified exact locator + current membership and retained read policy; no excerpt or substitution"]
    Denied["401 sign-in or identical generic 404 for unknown/denied; withhold protected data"]
    Authority["Authority failure: fail closed; generic service error; no cached/unrestricted fallback"]
    AIError["AI dependency error/timeout/budget: explicit failure, no generated answer"]
    Fallback["Keyword search and document/work UI when own dependencies healthy"]
    KnowledgeError["Knowledge outage: documents/document search unavailable; Workspace work and optional task search may continue"]
    Start --> Read
    Read -->|Permitted| Scope
    Read -->|Unauthenticated / denied| Denied
    Read -->|Unknown authority| Authority
    Scope --> Enough
    Enough -->|No| Insufficient
    Enough -->|Yes| Provider
    Provider -->|Handoff succeeds| Generate
    Provider -->|Evidence revoked: exclude; retry chosen with budget and safe evidence| Retry
    Provider -->|Check failed| Authority
    Generate -->|Complete| Validate
    Generate -->|Dependency failed| AIError
    Validate --> Delivery
    Delivery --> Safe
    Safe -->|Yes| Answer
    Safe -->|Invalid claims/citations or revoked evidence| Withhold
    Delivery -->|Check failed| Authority
    Withhold -->|Retry chosen with budget and safe evidence| Retry
    Retry --> Read
    Answer --> Click
    Click --> Citation
    Citation -->|Accessible and available| Inspect
    Citation -->|Readable identity; evidence unavailable| Unavailable
    Citation -->|Unknown / inaccessible| Denied
    Citation -->|Check failed| Authority
    AIError --> Fallback
    Read -->|Knowledge unavailable| KnowledgeError
    Citation -->|Knowledge unavailable| KnowledgeError
    Fallback -->|Keyword dependency unavailable| KnowledgeError
    Withhold -->|No retry, budget exhausted or no safe evidence| Unable
    Provider -->|Evidence revoked: no retry, budget exhausted or no safe evidence| Unable
